^warning: ignoring
--
Inside __invoke<_Transform, void (*)(), int>, instantiated from
_Binder::_S_call, decltype(_S_test<_Callable, _Args...>(0)) was the type
of the variadic C-style operator() (_Partial): the pack expansion
`_Args...' kept one element.  The caller's one-element pack
(`__call_args..., 0') was still in the template map, and the
single-element pack substitution of the body removed every ellipsis, not
just those of patterns naming the substituted pack.  Now the two-parameter
template is selected.  N5008 [temp.variadic]/8-9.  Reduced from
cpp20_range_adaptor_closure_invoked_through_invoke_impl.
